@ythril-network/schema
Copyright Ythril contributors

This product is the vocabulary of a Ythril space schema and the validator a Ythril server runs on it, published for apps
that write schemas. It is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE), unlike the Ythril server, whose
licence is the repository's.

This package bundles no third-party code: its `dist` is compiled from its own `src` only.

---

## Runtime dependencies (installed by npm, not bundled)

npm installs the packages below beside this one; each is distributed under its own licence, named here with its
copyright notice. This list is the package's whole production closure, read from the repository's lock file and held
to it by `testing/standalone/the-schema-package-notice-names-its-production-closure.test.js`.

