## The caller's own TypeScript compiler (neither bundled nor installed)

The `@ythril-network/schema/from-typescript` entry reads TypeScript source with the caller's own `typescript` (Apache License 2.0, Microsoft Corporation), loaded only when that entry is called and neither bundled with this package nor installed by npm beside it: it is an optional peer dependency, so the production closure above does not include it.
